          "boundary": "Complete public Lanczos3 Resize, local admission, independent output materialization and disposal on resident packed RGBA. FFmpeg zscale's zimg backend, radius3, encoded-space premultiplied filtering with unclipped float output. Timed packed input normalization and eight-pixel clamped halo, filtering, fresh planar/packed output ownership, unrounded-alpha division, quantization and release. Graph/input/scratch contexts reused; no converted input or output cache. Exact independent decimal/BigInteger managed pixels; native RGB/alpha max1/RMSE.25. One pinned CPU, normal SIMD, no concurrency. Startup/IPC/I/O/validation excluded."
